@segment 53-60 Felwood, Winterspring, Burning Steppes, Plaguelands & Silithus
@start-level 53
# Added 2026-11-11 from the Questie audit (tools/questie_near.py): 6164 Augustus' Receipt Book (1400 XP, Terrordale, beside Egan; the book's spot is in the Questie data).
# Segment 18's carry-out: Linken's Sword, The New Springs, Marvon's Workshop and Fuely's Felwood slime quest (4293).
# Segment 18 finishes the Seeping Corruption chain (3568 -> 3569 -> 3570) and hands in ... and a Batch of Ooze (4294) at its
# Undercity stop after Azshara, so neither is carried. 4294 is listed as done because Melding of Influences (4642) needs it.
@carry 3908,980,4147,4293
@done 3845,974,4145,4294
# Order: Felwood (south) -> north Felwood -> Timbermaw Hold -> Winterspring (west to Everlook) ->
# Thunder Bluff / Ratchet / Gadgetzan / Un'Goro -> hearth Everlook -> Felwood again -> Moonglade -> Winterspring again ->
# Undercity -> Burning Steppes -> Western Plaguelands -> Eastern Plaguelands -> Undercity / Western Plaguelands north ->
# Orgrimmar / Thunder Bluff -> Un'Goro -> Silithus -> Moonglade -> Undercity.
# Left out on purpose: elites (5156, 5121, 4023, 5098, 5153, 3962, 6025, 6041, 6135, 6136, 6148), The Videre Elixir and the
# rest of Linken's chain (needs a Feralas trip for the elixir and ends in elite 3962), the Scholomance key chain 838/964/5514/5802
# (needs elite 5098), 5154/5210/5181 (need elite 5153), 4022 (needs 3481, which needs elite 3452), Felnok's 4808-4810
# (Winterspring is finished before the Burning Steppes), Wild Guardians part 3 (4721, one more Winterspring round trip),
# Lorax's Tale (5126, needs 55 when you pass him), Volcanic Activity (4502, only handed in at Ratchet) and Rabine's
# Shards of the Felvine (5526, Dire Maul). Mission Accomplished! after the last cauldron is an N step: its ID is swapped
# between the factions in the data (5237 / 5238).
# Quest XP covers a bit over half of 53-60, so the L steps carry the rest (about 4 levels of grinding in all).
# Coordinate overrides fix auto data that puts Kargath NPCs in "Outland", Vandis/Derrington in the wrong zone, and FC pins
# filed under the wrong zone (Islen, Jessica Redpath, the Deadwood Cauldron, Sprinkle, Quixxil).

# ---------- Felwood: Emerald Sanctuary ----------
FLY Splintertree Post | You start at Valormok, level 53, with your hearthstone set to Orgrimmar. Kroum is the wind rider master
G Felwood, 50.9, 85.0 | Ride west from Splintertree to the main road and follow it north into Felwood. The Emerald Sanctuary is the first camp past the border
A 8460 | Grazle, beside the road just south of the Emerald Sanctuary. If he offers a Timbermaw Ally that asks for 5 of each furbolg instead (Forever lists a new 6131), take that one; the logger records it
A 5155 | Greta Mosshoof, Emerald Sanctuary
A 4102 | Maybess Riverbreeze, on the west side of the camp
C 8460 @ Felwood, 47.5, 91.0 | Deadwood Village, west of the road just south of the camp: Warriors, Pathfinders and Gardeners. Each kill also raises Timbermaw reputation, which you need for the tunnel later. Leave Overlord Ror (the big one at the south end) until you have his quest from Bloodvenom Post
T 8460 | Grazle
A 8462 | Grazle. Nafien waits at the north end of Felwood

# ---------- Jaedenar and Bloodvenom Post ----------
N Kill the slimes you pass from now on | Cursed Oozes (41, 71) and Tainted Oozes (42, 47) sit beside the road. Collect 15-20 Felwood Slime Samples for Chemist Fuely's test in the Undercity (4293): not every sample tests as corrupted, you need 5 that do, and the route does not come back to Felwood after the Undercity. They stack, so spares cost nothing
C 5155 @ Felwood, 38.0, 61.0 | Jaedenar, west of the road: the hounds, guardsmen, adepts and cultists near the entrance. Don't go deep yet
F Bloodvenom Post @ Felwood, 34.4, 53.8 | Brakkar, the wind rider master, a little further north
A 4505 | Winna Hazzard
A 4521 | Trull Failbane. His owlbeasts are in Winterspring
A 6162 | Dreka'Sur. Overlord Ror is in Deadwood Village; you pass it again soon
C 4505 @ Felwood, 32.3, 66.5 | The corrupted moonwell at the Ruins of Constellas, south-west of Jaedenar. Use Winna's flask at the well; Jadefire satyrs guard it
T 4505 | Back to Winna Hazzard, Bloodvenom Post
A 4506 | She hands you a kitten
C 4506 @ Felwood, 32.3, 66.5 | Same moonwell at the Ruins of Constellas. Release the kitten at the well, wait until it has changed, then take it back
T 4506 | Winna Hazzard. Click the cat at her feet to finish
T 5155 | Ride back south along the road to Greta Mosshoof, Emerald Sanctuary
A 5157 | Greta gives you an Empty Canteen
C 5157 @ Felwood, 35.2, 59.8 | The moon well in the middle of Jaedenar. Clear a path to it and fill the canteen
T 5157 | Back to Greta Mosshoof
A 5158 | Islen Waterseer is on the Barrens coast; you see her later in this segment
C 6162 @ Felwood, 48.2, 94.3 | Overlord Ror, at the south end of Deadwood Village, just south of the camp. Take his claw
T 6162 | Dreka'Sur, Bloodvenom Post, as you ride north

# ---------- North Felwood ----------
G Felwood, 42.0, 47.0 | Ride north past Bloodvenom Post on the main road. The Tainted Oozes here count for the slime samples
C 4102 @ Felwood, 57.5, 22.0 | Irontree Cavern, north-east of Irontree Woods: Warpwood Moss Flayers and Shredders drop Blood Amber. Dessecus (rare elite) walks the cave, so stay near the mouth
T 8462 | Nafien, outside Timbermaw Hold at the far north end of the road
A 8461 | Nafien
C 8461 @ Felwood, 61.5, 8.0 | Felpaw Village, just west of Nafien: Den Watchers, Avengers and Shamans. Frost Nova, then Blizzard
T 8461 | Nafien
A 8465 | Nafien
L 54 @ Felwood, 61.5, 8.0 | Quest XP is far behind in this segment. Grind Felpaw Village to 54: the Deadwood furbolgs stand in packs and every kill adds Timbermaw reputation as well. Keep every Runecloth they drop and don't vendor it: Meilosh inside Timbermaw Hold wants 30 for a quest later
N Open the Reputation tab and check Timbermaw Hold before going in | It must be Unfriendly or better, or the furbolgs inside attack you. Still Hostile? Kill more Deadwood furbolgs here until it changes. Got Deadwood Headdress Feathers? Nafien takes them 5 at a time (Feathers for Nafien, repeatable, about 550 XP and Timbermaw reputation each); bring later sets on your next tunnel passes
N Keep any Deadwood or Winterfall Ritual Totem that drops (8470 / 8471) | Deadwood and Winterfall furbolgs drop them rarely. Once Timbermaw Hold is Neutral, right-click the totem and hand it to Kernda inside the Hold (Felwood 65.5, 3.5) on one of your tunnel trips

# ---------- Winterspring: the west ----------
G Winterspring, 27.7, 34.5 | Go through Timbermaw Hold and take the Winterspring exit. Never attack the Timbermaw furbolgs inside
T 8465 | Salfa, at the tunnel exit
A 8464 | Salfa. Winterfall Shaman and Ursa live in Winterfall Village in the east, next to Everlook
T 3908 | Donova Snowden, beside the hot springs to the south-east. She offers The Videre Elixir next: skip it, it needs a long Feralas trip and the chain ends in an elite quest
T 980 | Donova Snowden
A 4842 | Donova Snowden. You check the far south of Winterspring later on this pass
N Kill the Winterfall furbolgs in the camp east of Donova (around 41, 44) until one drops an Empty Firewater Flask | Pathfinders, Totemics and Den Watchers all drop it. Right-click the flask
A 5083 @ Winterspring, 41.0, 44.0 | The Empty Firewater Flask
T 5083 | Donova Snowden
A 5084 | Keep it: the cauldron is in Felwood and you pass it on your second visit

# ---------- Winterspring: the far south and Everlook ----------
C 4521:2 @ Winterspring, 46.5, 44.0 | Ragged Owlbeasts in the woods east of the hot springs
C 4842 @ Winterspring, 59.8, 74.3 | Ride to the far south until the sky turns dark at Darkwhisper Gorge. Reaching the mouth of the gorge is enough; the demons further in are elite
G Winterspring, 60.4, 36.4 | Ride north to Everlook
F Everlook | Yugrek, the wind rider master
S Everlook | Innkeeper Vizzie. You hearth back here later
A 6603 | Meggi Peppinrocker. It goes to Donova on your next pass
A 3783 | Umi Rumplesnicker
C 8464 @ Winterspring, 67.0, 37.0 | Winterfall Village, just east of Everlook: Shaman, Den Watchers and Ursa. High Chief Winterfall in the big cave is elite: stay out of it
L 56 @ Winterspring, 67.0, 37.0 | Stay in Winterfall Village and grind to 56 before the yetis: the furbolg packs are ideal for Frost Nova and Blizzard. Being 56 also lets you take Rabine's Silithus quest in Moonglade later, and it shortens the grind before the Plaguelands
C 3783 @ Winterspring, 67.5, 44.0 | Ice Thistle Yetis on the hills south-east of the village drop Thick Yeti Furs
T 3783 | Umi Rumplesnicker, Everlook
A 977
C 977 @ Winterspring, 69.0, 41.0 | Ice Thistle Matriarchs and Patriarchs (level 56-58) higher up in the Ice Thistle Hills. Pull them one at a time
T 977 | Umi Rumplesnicker
A 5163 | Umi gives you her Mechanical Yeti
C 5163:1 | Legacki, in Everlook. Use the yeti next to her
C 4521:1 @ Winterspring, 58.5, 31.0 | Raging Owlbeasts around Starfall Village, just north-west of Everlook

# ---------- Thunder Bluff, Ratchet, Gadgetzan, Un'Goro ----------
N Teleport: Thunder Bluff (or fly there from Everlook if you don't have it)
TRAIN | Thunder Bluff, Spirit Rise: learn your level 54 and 56 spells
A 1000 | Bluff Runner Windstrider, on the central rise
T 1000 | Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem, Elder Rise
A 1123 | Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem. Rabine Saturna is in Moonglade; you go there on your next Felwood trip
N Still carrying Morrowgrain Research (3786) from last segment? | Hand 10 Morrowgrain to Bashana Runetotem on Elder Rise now
FLY Ratchet
T 4147 | Liv Rizzlefix. Skip her follow-ups
T 5158 @ The Barrens, 65.8, 43.8 | Islen Waterseer, on the coast a short ride south of Ratchet
A 5159 @ The Barrens, 65.8, 43.8 | Islen Waterseer. The purified water goes back to Greta in Felwood
FLY Gadgetzan
C 5163:2 @ Tanaris, 51.1, 26.9 | Sprinkle, in Gadgetzan. Use the yeti next to her
FLY Marshal's Refuge
C 5163:3 @ Un'Goro Crater, 43.7, 9.4 | Quixxil, in Marshal's Refuge
N Still carrying ... and a Batch of Ooze (4294) from last segment? Kill oozes here until you have 15-20 Un'Goro Slime Samples | Skip this if you handed it in last segment. Any Un'Goro ooze drops them. Closest: Primal Oozes just south of Marshal's Refuge (around 46, 24) and Glutinous Oozes to the south-west (around 35, 30); Muculent Oozes sit east of the camp (62-74, 25-35). Not every sample tests as pure and you need 5 that do. They stack
H Everlook
T 5163 | Umi Rumplesnicker

