# ---------- North Felwood, Moonglade, Winterspring again ----------
G Felwood, 60.2, 5.8 | Ride north up the road to Felpaw Village
T 5084 | The Deadwood Cauldron in the middle of Felpaw Village
A 5085 @ Felwood, 60.2, 5.8 | The Deadwood Cauldron
N Go into Timbermaw Hold | Neutral with Timbermaw and carrying a Ritual Totem? Hand it to Kernda in the main hall on the way (8470 / 8471). Nafien at the entrance still takes Deadwood Headdress Feathers 5 at a time
A 6031 @ Felwood, 65.7, 2.8 | Meilosh, in the main hall of Timbermaw Hold beside Kernda. Needs Friendly with Timbermaw (the Felpaw and Winterfall grinds should have got you there) and 30 Runecloth. Not Friendly yet or short of cloth? Take it on a later tunnel pass
T 6031 | Meilosh
N Take the branch of Timbermaw Hold that leads to Moonglade
T 1123 | Rabine Saturna, in Nighthaven
A 1124 | Keep Rabine's Letter: Layo Starstrike is in Silithus, at the end of the segment
A 5527 | Rabine Saturna. The reliquary is in Southwind Village in Silithus, where Layo's quests send you anyway
F Moonglade | Faustron, the Horde flight master by the lake. You fly back here at the end of the segment
N Go back into Timbermaw Hold and take the Winterspring exit
T 8464 | Salfa. From now on Salfa also takes Winterfall Spirit Beads 5 at a time (Beads for Salfa, repeatable, about 575 XP and Timbermaw reputation each): the Winterfall furbolgs drop them, so hand in each set as you pass by
T 5085 | Donova Snowden
A 5086 | Donova Snowden
T 6603 | Donova Snowden
A 5082 | Donova Snowden
T 4842 | Donova Snowden
C 5082:1,5082:3 @ Winterspring, 41.0, 44.0 | The Winterfall camp east of Donova: Pathfinders and Totemics (the camp near Salfa has more of both). Kill the one Den Watcher here too (1 of 8). Only 4 Den Watchers stand in the west, so you clear both camps twice for the 8
N Go back through Timbermaw Hold into Felwood for the Toxic Horrors | On the way, kill the three Winterfall Den Watchers at the camp just south-east of Salfa (around 30.5, 36): 4 of 8
C 5086 @ Felwood, 49.3, 25.0 | Irontree Woods, south-west of Felpaw Village: Toxic Horrors drop the droplets
N Go back through Timbermaw Hold to Winterspring | Neutral with Timbermaw and carrying a Ritual Totem? Hand it to Kernda inside the Hold now (8470 / 8471). Didn't get Meilosh's Runecloth quest earlier? Try again now
N Kill the 3 Den Watchers at the camp just south-east of Salfa (30.5, 36.3) again: they have respawned since you passed | That makes 7 of 8. Spare beads? Salfa is right there
C 5082:2 @ Winterspring, 41.6, 42.6 | The 8th is the lone Den Watcher at the east camp, which has respawned too. Donova is a short ride back west
T 5082,5086 | Donova Snowden
A 5087 | Donova Snowden
C 5087 @ Winterspring, 28.0, 34.5 | Winterfall Runners leave the Timbermaw tunnel and walk east toward Winterfall Village. Kill them for the Winterfall Crate
T 5087 | Donova Snowden. Skip High Chief Winterfall (elite)
C 4741 @ Winterspring, 63.5, 17.0 | Moontouched Owlbeasts in the north, past Starfall Village. If a Blue-feathered Necklace drops, keep it (don't farm for it)
L 57 @ Winterspring, 67.0, 37.0 | Still behind. Grind Winterfall Village to 57 before you leave Kalimdor; the Plaguelands quests are level 55-60
G Winterspring, 60.4, 36.4 | Everlook
A 6029,6030 | Gregor Greystone. Both are deliveries to the Plaguelands
A 5601 @ Winterspring, 61.3, 39.0 | Jessica Redpath. Also for the Plaguelands
FLY Bloodvenom Post
T 4741 | Trull Failbane. Skip Wild Guardians part 3; it sends you back to Winterspring
N Got a Blue-feathered Necklace? | Right-click it and hand it to Trull (Guarding Secrets, 4882), then take his follow-up (4883) for Nara Wildmane in Thunder Bluff near the end of the segment

# ---------- Undercity ----------
N Teleport: Undercity (or fly to Orgrimmar and take the zeppelin if you don't have it)
C 4293 @ Undercity, 47.5, 73.3 | Apothecarium: use the Testing Equipment next to Chemist Fuely on your Felwood slime samples until you have 5 Corrupted Felwood Samples. Still carrying ... and a Batch of Ooze (4294)? Test the Un'Goro samples too and hand it in with this one
T 4293 | Chemist Fuely
A 4642 | Chemist Fuely gives you an Encased Corrupt Ooze. You release it in Un'Goro near the end of the segment
