# ---------- Light's Hope and Corin's Crossing ----------
G Eastern Plaguelands, 71.0, 50.5 | Ride east along the southern road to Light's Hope Chapel. Plaguehounds and Noxious Plaguebats on the way count
F Light's Hope Chapel @ Eastern Plaguelands, 70.5, 47.5 | Georgia, the bat handler, just north-west of the chapel
T 5241 | Carlin Redpath
A 5211 | Carlin Redpath
T 6030 | Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff
A 6021 | Caretaker Alen
A 5281 | Caretaker Alen. You only have to find Egan, who stands outside by the Plaguewood termite mounds you visit anyway. Take just this first part: his follow-up is inside Stratholme
C 6022 @ Eastern Plaguelands, 52.0, 57.0 | Corin's Crossing, west of Light's Hope. Gather 7 Living Rot within 10 minutes and grind them with Nathanos' Mortar and Pestle. The Gibbering Ghouls here also count for Carlin: each one releases a Darrowshire Spirit when it dies, so talk to the spirit to free it. There are only 8 of them, so you finish the 15 spirits later in Plaguewood
L 58 @ Eastern Plaguelands, 52.0, 57.0 | Grind Corin's Crossing to 58, TUGs' grind spot here: ghouls, Dark Casters and Plaguehounds in tight groups (Frost Nova, then Blizzard). Keep freeing the spirits the respawned Gibbering Ghouls leave. The north of the zone is level 58-60

# ---------- Eastern Plaguelands: the north and back west ----------
C 5544 @ Eastern Plaguelands, 58.5, 25.0 | Carrion Devourers in the north-east toward Northdale; the Carrion Grubs around Corin's Crossing also count. Diseased Flayers stand right next to them (around 57, 31) and release Darrowshire Spirits too
C 6024 @ Eastern Plaguelands, 62.0, 11.1 | Infiltrator Hameya, a lone troll in the far north. Take his key
C 6133 @ Eastern Plaguelands, 45.5, 12.5 | Quel'Lithien Lodge, in the north: Rangers, Pathstriders and Woodsmen. The Quel'Thalas Registry is on a table inside the lodge
C 5542,6042 | Frenzied Plaguehounds in the north (around 52, 23) and the other hounds along the roads; Monstrous Plaguebats in the north (around 48, 35) and Noxious Plaguebats around Light's Hope
C 5901,5211 @ Eastern Plaguelands, 18.0, 25.0 | Plaguewood, in the north-west: use the Empty Termite Jar on the Large Termite Mounds until you have 100 termites. The Cannibal Ghouls all over Plaguewood release Darrowshire Spirits: free the rest of your 15 here
T 5281 @ Eastern Plaguelands, 11.4, 26.6 | Egan, in Terrordale just west of the termite mounds. Don't take his follow-up (Stratholme)
A 6164 | Augustus the Touched, in a cave at Terrordale, a few steps from Egan
C 6164 @ Eastern Plaguelands, 14.0, 24.2 | Augustus' Receipt Book lies in the ruined inn at Terrordale, a short walk north-east of his cave, upstairs. Crypt Fiends and Crypt Walkers (53-56) live in and around it: pull them one at a time
T 6164 | Augustus the Touched
C 5543 | Plaguebats fly all over the west and south of the zone
