T 6024 @ Eastern Plaguelands, 23.6, 73.8 | Use Hameya's Key on the Mound of Dirt beside the wagon behind the crypt
T 6022,6042,6133 | Nathanos Blightcaller, Marris Stead. Skip his elite follow-ups
