# ---------- Orgrimmar, Thunder Bluff, Un'Goro ----------
N Teleport: Orgrimmar (or take the zeppelin from the Undercity if you don't have it)
A 8276 | Cenarion Emissary Blackhoof, in the Valley of Strength by the main gate
N Saved cloth? Orgrimmar takes cloth donations | Rashona Straglash and Vehena each take 60 wool, 60 silk, 60 mageweave and then 60 runecloth (7826, 7827, 7831, 7824 and 7833-7836). Every hand-in gives experience
N Teleport: Thunder Bluff (or fly there if you don't have it)
T 4987 | Nara Wildmane, Elder Rise
N Carrying Guarding Secrets (4883)? Hand it to Nara Wildmane as well | Rumstag Proudstrider also takes cloth donations here (7820-7823)
FLY Marshal's Refuge
C 4642 @ Un'Goro Crater, 47.0, 25.0 | Primal Oozes just south of Marshal's Refuge (also at 52, 18 and 39, 17). Open the Encased Corrupt Ooze next to one; the two merge into a Gargantuan Ooze. Kill it and loot the Merged Ooze Sample
N Ride to the north-west corner of Un'Goro and follow the ridge path west into Silithus | It comes out at Valor's Rest, the graveyard in the north-east of Silithus

