# ---------- Moonglade and the Undercity ----------
N Teleport: Orgrimmar, then fly to Moonglade | Already 60? Stop here: the route is done. No flight to Moonglade offered? Fly to Bloodvenom Post and ride north through Timbermaw Hold
T 6844 | Umber, in Nighthaven
A 6845 | Umber
T 6845,5527 | Rabine Saturna. Skip her follow-up (Shards of the Felvine is in Dire Maul)
A 1185 | Umber
T 1185 | Umber
N Teleport: Undercity
T 4642 | Chemist Fuely, Apothecarium
N Saved cloth? Ralston Farnsley in the Undercity takes donations too (7813, 7814, 7817, 7818)
T 8859 @ Eastern Plaguelands, 71.9, 48.4 | Not 60 yet? Fly from the Undercity to Light's Hope Chapel and hand Zora's husk to Lord Maxwell Tyrosus
L 60 @ Eastern Plaguelands, 52.0, 57.0 | Finish at Corin's Crossing, just west of Light's Hope. Rather fly than grind? If you took Nestor's and Eazel's husks, Overseer Oilfist at Thorium Point (Searing Gorge flight path) takes 8858 and Oglethorpe Obnoticus in Booty Bay takes 8857, about 10,000 XP each
TRAIN | Learn your level 60 spells at any mage trainer. Route complete
